Z||000003||Monkeyman||11-18-2001||02:12 PM||||I was actually considering a late '80s non-turbo.  They seem to be about 2 grand cheaper than the turbos and there are many aftermarket turbo kits available.  The '87s (from what little I've read) seem to come fairly well equipped.  200hp, but a heavy car.  I've heard they last forever, too except for a head gasket problem.  Anyone have any pics of the interior?||||reg||1
